# Fetched to <folder root>/.stignore on every machine that syncs this folder.
# Syncthing never syncs .stignore itself, so this repository is what keeps the
# machines on one list. Edits made in the Syncthing web UI are overwritten on
# the next fetch -- change them here instead.
#
# Patterns are relative to the folder root.
#
# ~/.claude holds two kinds of content. Portable configuration -- CLAUDE.md,
# settings.json, agents/ -- is shared. Machine-local state is not: it carries
# absolute paths, per-host caches and credentials, and syncing it breaks the
# other machine. Everything below is the second kind.

# Plugin cache and install records. installed_plugins.json stores absolute
# install paths, so an entry written on one machine points nowhere on the
# other, the plugin is marked orphaned and its skills silently stop loading.
# Each machine installs its own copy from the enabledPlugins and
# extraKnownMarketplaces declarations in settings.json, which is synced.
Claude/.claude/plugins

# Session transcripts and auto-memory, stored under path-derived directory
# names that never match across machines.
Claude/.claude/projects
Claude/.claude/sessions
Claude/.claude/session-env

# Per-machine runtime state.
Claude/.claude/shell-snapshots
Claude/.claude/file-history
Claude/.claude/backups
Claude/.claude/ide
Claude/.claude/.last-cleanup
Claude/.claude/.caveman-*

# OAuth token for the Claude account. Must stay on the machine that obtained
# it; replicating it also copies it into .stversions, where neither logout nor
# a token rotation reaches it.
Claude/.claude/.credentials.json

# macOS directory metadata, deletable when it alone blocks removing a folder.
(?d)**/.DS_Store
